WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.782 --> 00:00:05.900 line:90%
 Hello Marvelites.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.220 line:90%
I'm Ryan a.k.a.

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.610 line:10%
Agent M. I've got Bill Rosemann.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:09.920 line:90%
 Hey there.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.390 line:90%
 Eric Monacelli.

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:13.840 line:84%
And we just debuted the
trailer for Marvel's Avengers.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:14.640 line:90%
Let's take a look.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.510 line:84%
 Cap, what's going
on over there?

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:25.330 line:90%
 Uh!

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:26.240 line:90%
 Start the Chimera.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.180 line:90%
What's your status?

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.872 line:90%
 You should head back.

00:00:29.872 --> 00:00:31.345 line:90%
 No, stay on task.

00:00:31.345 --> 00:00:33.309 line:84%
There's still civilians
on this bridge.

00:00:36.255 --> 00:00:38.710 line:90%
 (WHISPERING) Captain.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:40.183 line:90%
 Damn it, they played us.

00:00:46.748 --> 00:00:47.548 line:90%
 No.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.210 line:84%
 You guys just saw the
trailer for Marvel's Avengers,

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:57.080 line:84%
and oh, boy, very
exciting, boys.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:57.880 line:90%
 Yes.

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.850 line:84%
 And so we're here to
tell you all about six

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:03.439 line:84%
things we just learned
about Marvel's Avengers.

00:01:03.439 --> 00:01:04.239 line:90%
You guys, ready?

00:01:04.239 --> 00:01:05.480 line:84%
- We're ready.
- OK.

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:06.280 line:90%
First things first.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:07.080 line:90%
 Yes.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.160 line:10%
 We have a release date.

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:09.080 line:10%
- We do.
- We do.

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:09.880 line:10%
Amazing.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:10.840 line:10%
 We do.

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:14.200 line:10%
 It's May 15, 2020.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.570 line:10%
And a lot of platforms.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:16.520 line:10%
 A lot of platforms.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:21.110 line:10%
So it'll be on PS4,
Xbox, PC, and Stadia.

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:21.910 line:10%
 Woo.

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:23.200 line:10%
I like that.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.330 line:10%
Very exciting.

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:27.910 line:10%
OK so, number two, we know
who the Avengers team is.

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:28.870 line:10%
 We do indeed.

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:29.950 line:10%
 Can you give us that roster?

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:31.840 line:10%
 Well, what would the
Avengers be without a leader

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:33.240 line:10%
like Captain America?

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:34.645 line:90%
 Who is played by Jeff Shine.

00:01:34.645 --> 00:01:36.520 line:84%
RYAN PENAGOS: Right hand
man, flying through the sky,

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:38.530 line:90%
the armored avenger, Iron Man.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:39.725 line:90%
ERIC MONACELLI: By Nolan North.

00:01:39.725 --> 00:01:40.525 line:90%
BILL ROSEMANN:

00:01:40.525 --> 00:01:44.260 line:84%
RYAN PENAGOS: How about the
guardian god of thunder, Thor?

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:46.150 line:84%
ERIC MONACELLI: That would
be Travis Willingham.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:50.500 line:84%
RYAN PENAGOS: How about the
ultimate spy, Black Widow?

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.030 line:90%
ERIC MONACELLI: Laura Bailey.

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:53.710 line:84%
RYAN PENAGOS: And
you know sometimes,

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:56.790 line:84%
you need a doctor on your team
that may unleash a rage beast.

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:59.320 line:84%
I'm talking about Dr.
Bruce Banner and the Hulk.

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:00.220 line:90%
ERIC MONACELLI: Troy Baker.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.020 line:90%
RYAN PENAGOS: Oh.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:03.090 line:84%
You guys, and you didn't
even rehearse this.

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:04.630 line:90%
You guys are wonderful.

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:06.460 line:84%
So we got to talk
about the game story.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:09.850 line:10%
We learned a lot about what the
story is for Marvel's Avengers.

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:11.500 line:10%
BILL ROSEMANN: So
as you saw tonight,

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:14.080 line:10%
the game story begins on A-Day.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.940 line:84%
It's a celebration
of the Avengers.

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:20.560 line:84%
However, during A-Day,
tragedy strikes.

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:23.230 line:90%
There is some devastation.

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:24.790 line:90%
Things go south.

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:25.683 line:90%
Is it a setup?

00:02:25.683 --> 00:02:26.550 line:10%
ERIC MONACELLI: Who knows?

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:28.240 line:10%
BILL ROSEMANN: We'll see.
They're blamed for the tragedy.

00:02:28.395 --> 00:02:29.462 line:10%
ERIC MONACELLI: They are blamed.

00:02:29.462 --> 00:02:31.270 line:10%
BILL ROSEMANN: They're
blamed for the devastation.

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:37.350 line:10%
But five years later,
a new evil arises

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:43.030 line:10%
and our only hope for the world
is for Earth's Mightiest Heroes

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.253 line:10%
to reassemble once again.

00:02:45.253 --> 00:02:46.120 line:10%
ERIC MONACELLI: I like it.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:46.920 line:90%
All right.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.560 line:84%
That's all we can
talk about the story.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.920 line:84%
But the story's only
part of the whole thing.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.600 line:10%
We also learned
about the game play.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:54.760 line:10%
ERIC MONACELLI:
The gameplay, yes.

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:56.680 line:10%
So we'll have a single
player campaign,

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:59.140 line:10%
which covered off most of
what we heard in the story.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.330 line:10%
But also we'll be
continuing that narrative

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:07.483 line:10%
for years and years to come in
a multiplayer four player co-op.

00:03:07.483 --> 00:03:09.550 line:84%
ERIC MONACELLI: You just hit two
of the most important points.

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:11.370 line:84%
Because single player
and co-op and that

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.770 line:84%
we're going to be
playing for a long time.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.003 line:10%
BILL ROSEMANN: Which
means there will

00:03:14.003 --> 00:03:17.290 line:10%
be new additional
heroes and regions

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.630 line:10%
that will cost you nothing.

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:19.430 line:10%
ERIC MONACELLI: Zero.

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:20.560 line:10%
RYAN PENAGOS: Bam, bam.

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.990 line:10%
OK, finally, we learned
that the game is

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:24.780 line:10%
going to be super customizable.
BILL ROSEMANN: Yeah.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:24.950 line:10%
ERIC MONACELLI: Yeah.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.050 line:10%
RYAN PENAGOS: Tell
me about that.

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:27.490 line:10%
ERIC MONACELLI: So
we'll have our heroes

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:29.560 line:10%
that you can get for--

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:30.820 line:10%
BILL ROSEMANN: Free.

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:32.820 line:10%
ERIC MONACELLI: And those
heroes will have outfits,

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:35.100 line:10%
some originals, some of
your fan favorite outfits,

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:36.640 line:10%
some classic outfit.

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:38.500 line:10%
Just everything
you could try on.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:39.370 line:10%
Check them out.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:41.530 line:10%
And we'll have all these
different heroes that we'll

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.000 line:10%
be unlocking over time.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:44.587 line:10%
BILL ROSEMANN: And
some all new designs.

00:03:44.587 --> 00:03:45.520 line:10%
ERIC MONACELLI: New designs.

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:48.220 line:10%
BILL ROSEMANN: That Crystal
and Marvel Games collaborated

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:50.017 line:10%
on made just for this game.

00:03:50.017 --> 00:03:51.250 line:10%
ERIC MONACELLI: It's
pretty exciting.

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:52.210 line:84%
BILL ROSEMANN: Yes.
ERIC MONACELLI: Very exciting.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.670 line:84%
ERIC MONACELLI: Lots more for us
to talk about, share, and learn

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.180 line:90%
for Marvel's Avengers.

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:56.980 line:90%
Gentlemen.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:57.790 line:90%
Thank you very much.

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:58.720 line:90%
BILL ROSEMANN: Reassemble.

